From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 14:35:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 40/44] Add an interface to Message_forwarding
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

The interface makes the compiler report the values that are never
used; remove them.

Signed-off-by: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
---
 ocaml/xapi/message_forwarding.ml  | 27 -------------
 ocaml/xapi/message_forwarding.mli | 65 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 quality-gate.sh                   |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ocaml/xapi/message_forwarding.mli

diff --git a/ocaml/xapi/message_forwarding.ml b/ocaml/xapi/message_forwarding.ml
